  21:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * @fn State_t Zero_Fine_State(Context_t*, Event_t*)
  22:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * @brief State handler for fine movement in homing (zero commmand).
  23:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * This moves the stepper very slowly in the same direction as when the state is
  24:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * entered until the sign of the projection reverses. The amplitude of the projection near the
  25:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * electrial zero fluctuates a lot and is less reliable than the sign. The sign reversal indicates
  26:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * that the electrical zero of the lvdt has been found. The projection is given by:
  27:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * Re{s/p} where s = complex values secondary response p = complex valued primary response
  28:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  *
  29:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * @param context Focus state context
  30:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * @param event Incoming event
  31:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  * @return Next state
  32:../src/Focus_States/Zero_Fine_State.c ****  */
